  "details": "Currently, my ideal desktop HUD is almost attainable. Being able to have the HUD enabled, the opacity low, and the mic indicator only in the bottom-left corner is great because I see the mic indicator and nothing else. The issue is that it truly is absolutely nothing else, and I can no longer see incoming invites, boops, requests, group notifications, and so on. Having the ability to have the HUD opacity at 0% and the incoming notification opacity at 100% would be amazing.",
